<assumption_delta_decision>
Noun now primary: `baude_core::removal::{RemovalTarget, RemovalReport}` is the one removal contract; the TUI (Phase 20), the daemon REST surface and the PWA are three callers of it. Decision: no-change. Phase 18 already promoted the shared operation to core; this phase adds callers, not a second representation. A later phase that hand-rolls a daemon-side row set instead of calling core would be the regression; the recheck tests in 21-03 compare the daemon's response against `preview_removal` output, which goes red if that happens.
</assumption_delta_decision>

