st, None)`, otherwise `persist::save_for_workspace_status(STATE_BASE, baude_core::workspace::active(), file)`; on `Err` restores every runtime into `self.sessions` in id order (mirror `restore_row_runtimes`), clears `atomic_failure_for_test` in tests, and returns `Removal(error)`; on `Ok` removes the `runtime_checkouts` entries for every removed checkout, removes and notifies `permission_notify` for every consumed session id, sets `persistence_dirty` to whether `report.persistence` is `SavedDegraded`, and returns the report. Do not route through `Manager::remove` or `teardown_retained_runtime`: this is the Phase 18 force path, not the close protocol (removal.rs comment above `remove`). Add `#[cfg(test)] pub(crate) fn checkout_key_for_runtime_for_test(&self, id: u64) -> Option<CheckoutKey>`.

