| T-21-04 | Tampering | Manager::lift_suppression keyed by a client-supplied repo path | low | mitigate | The path is canonicalised and must be a directory before create proceeds; lift only forgets an entry for that exact folder key and never deletes anything on disk |
| T-21-SC | Tampering | npm/pip/cargo installs | high | mitigate | No package is added in this plan; package-legitimacy gate plus a blocking human checkpoint would apply to any [ASSUMED]/[SUS] crate |
</threat_model>

