y: auto }`, a `.danger` button and a `.section h3` label style within the existing palette variables. Do not touch native `confirm()` in `deleteSession`; that path is the Phase 7 kill, not removal. Commit as `feat(21-05): offer remove on every PWA row kind with a report-backed confirmation`.
