| T-21-10 | Spoofing | cross-origin POST /removals from another site | low | accept | Same tailnet posture as DELETE /sessions/{id}; auth is deferred per CONTEXT |
| T-21-SC | Tampering | npm/pip/cargo installs | high | mitigate | No package is added; node:test and node:assert are built into the runtime; package-legitimacy gate plus a blocking human checkpoint would apply to any [ASSUMED]/[SUS] package |
</threat_model>

