  <name>Task 1: Remote client removal calls, snapshot drops and the /events subscriber over a TcpListener double</name>
  <files>baude/src/remote.rs</files>
  <read_first>
    - baude/src/remote.rs lines 19-70 (RemoteInfo with serde default back-compat), 107-200 (RemoteSnapshot, RemotePoller::start poll thread, snapshot), 198-275 (delete, restart, create, set_archived, short_err: the ureq call shape and REQUEST_TIMEOUT)
    - baude-core/src/removal.rs lines 47-66 and 180-200 (RemovalTarget, RowKey, RemovalReport serde)
