  1110	/// present the runtime, path and persistence fields are what the stages
  1111	/// actually did. `planned` is what the clearing stage will attempt; the
  1112	/// preview reports it as `cleared`, the real run reports what the stage did.
  1113	fn report_from_set(
  1114	    set: &RemovalSet,
  1115	    planned: Vec<ClearedItem>,
   280	}
