I found two concrete blockers: the compatibility test explicitly forbids the `checkout_key` field that 21-02 adds, despite the plan requiring the test to stay unchanged; and 21-06 changes the modal and label APIs but omits their renderer in `ui.rs`. I also found that daemon-created plain checkouts currently use a different role from the one the `/rows` tests expect.
