     2	//! of [`Backend`]. A thin composition layer: the actual Claude-specific
     3	//! machinery stays in the modules that already own it ([`crate::hook`],
     4	//! [`crate::bridge`], [`crate::meta`], [`crate::permission`]); this impl is
