   311	/// Ingest one hook event line from a managed session's `baude hook` child
   312	/// (POSTed via the daemon-injected `$BAUDE_EVENT_URL`). The raw body is the
   313	/// already-built event line; it is appended to the same `/tmp` file the poll
   314	/// loop tails, converging the POST and file-tail transports (HOOK-03).
   315	///
   316	/// Security (T-02-08/09): the `Path<u64>` extractor rejects a non-numeric id
   317	/// at the framework layer; an unknown / unresolvable session is a 404 via
   318	/// `not_found`; a malformed body is appended best-effort. There is no 500
   319	/// path. No auth layer — the route inherits the tailnet/loopback-bound,
   320	/// single-user security model.
